{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41620","headline":"悲哉行 · 陈陶","name":"悲哉行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中岳仇先生，遗余饵松方。\n服之一千日，肢体生异香。\n步履如风旋，天涯不齎粮。\n仍云爲地仙，不得朝虚皇。\n狡兔有三穴，人生又何常。\n悲哉二廉士，饿死於首阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41620.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41620","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}